<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5 Results ‣ AInstein: Assessing the Feasibility of AI-Generated Approaches to Research Problems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Human-Verified Competitive Ranking.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 5 Results ‣ AInstein: Assessing the Feasibility of AI-Generated Approaches to Research Problems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Quantitative Text Analysis.</span></a></li>
