<td id="A2.T7.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">Flesch-Kincaid Grade*</td>
