<span id="A4.T8.2.1.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T8.2.1.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">3d, scene, point, view, motion</span>
</span></td>
